A joyful spring celebration scene in the style of Marc Chagall, featuring floating rabbits and decorated eggs drifting dreamlike through a blossoming orchard. Soft pastel colors dominate—lavender, pale yellow, robin's egg blue—with cherry blossom petals swirling in gentle spirals. A crescent moon hangs in a twilight sky alongside a warm sun, symbolizing renewal and cyclical time. Whimsical birds with elongated wings soar between flowering branches, and small village houses with colorful rooftops dot rolling green hills in the background. The composition has Chagall's signature floating, gravity-defying quality with figures and objects suspended at playful angles. Rich emotional warmth radiates through the scene, celebrating fertility, spring, and universal themes of rebirth across cultures. No text or letters anywhere in the image.
